{"reviews":[{"id":"B00CF2P7AY-0","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful Veil","x":"Loved this veil.  Fit her perfect and looked beautiful.  I had to secure the comb in place with a few bobby pins, but other than that, loved it.  I was always able to spot her in a crowd because she was the only one with a cross on her veil.  Received many complements on this veil.  Everyone thought the cross was a nice touch. I would highly recommend this veil.","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B00CF2P7AY-1","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"I loved the veil and my daughter received many compliments! She was also easily spotted in the crowd.","h":9,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B00CF2P7AY-2","r":5.0,"t":"Gorgeous veil","x":"this veil is so pretty and unique with its cross design. My daughter was a part of a very large first holy Communion group, and she was the only one with a veil that had this design. The veil is a perfect weight and size, so I would think most little girls would tolerate wearing it very well because it doesn't pull. However, my daughter has very thin, fine hair.  The comb attachment does not stay well in this type of hair. I had to use multiple bobby pins to secure it and it still moved out of p","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2015"},{"id":"B00CF2P7AY-3","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect","x":"This veil is pretty ! Came right on time and it's going to match perfectly with my daughter's communion dress. What I also like about it is , it's not a clip piece it's a comb piece and it securely stays in place with hair.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2016"},{"id":"B00CF2P7AY-4","r":5.0,"t":"Great Quality, Gorgeous","x":"This veil is so pretty.  Was a little nervous that it wouldn't be good material.  I was so pleased.  The cross was so precious. If your little girl needs a veil buy this one.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B00CF2P7AY-5","r":4.0,"t":"It was quite lovely except the embroidered piece in the ...","x":"It was quite lovely except the embroidered piece in the back was poorly secured...I had to sew it on to be assured that it would not fall off in church.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B00CF2P7AY-6","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful veil, nice quality and it was easy to ...","x":"Beautiful veil, nice quality and it was easy to keep in my daughter's hair.  Cross was a sweet touch.  It was easy to iron","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B00CF2P7AY-7","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Veil was gorgeous and fell beautifully when placed on the head. My daughter loved it!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2016"},{"id":"B00CF2P7AY-8","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful and Good Quality","x":"Beautiful veil for my daughter's 1st Communion. Came quickly and great quality.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B00CF2P7AY-9","r":3.0,"t":"Not exactly what I expected","x":"The veil I received did not have scalloped edges like the picture,  and the cross looks more like a plus sign ( don't think they cut it right before attaching). It will serve it's purpose for my daughter's first communion and since I don't have time to send it back, it'll do.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2015"},{"id":"B00CF2P7AY-10","r":5.0,"t":"Very nice Veil for First Communion.","x":"Very cute veil, simple yet elegant.  its perfect for wearing the hair half way up and curl on the side. the flowers on top made the veil classy not overdone.  The little cross at the bottom of the veil is a nice extra touch.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B00CF2P7AY-11","r":5.0,"t":"Gorgeous","x":"Beautiful. Very happy with my purchase. I was hesitant because one reviewer said the cross looks more like a plus sign, not at all. The quality is good, not flimsy like others I tried and it came ready to wear, not wrinkled.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2016"},{"id":"B00CF2P7AY-12","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful!","x":"This veil was absolutely beautiful.  It fit well and stayed in place.  We were very happy with it.  It also received my granddaughter's stamp of approval, which is hard to come by when placing somethings on her head.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2016"},{"id":"B00CF2P7AY-13","r":5.0,"t":"Lovely","x":"This veil is absolutely beautiful.  I have not seen anything like this in any stores in our area.  The embroidery of the cross is so different.  Love it so glad I purchased\u200b it for my granddaughter's special day.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B00CF2P7AY-14","r":5.0,"t":"Simple but beautiful enough to go with an elegant white First Holy Communion dress","x":"Very nice simple veil with a cross attached at the back. Goes well with and Elegant First Holy Communion dress. Doesn't take the beauty away from the Dress. Didn't want too much going on the veil.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B00CF2P7AY-15","r":3.0,"t":"The flower cross on it was missing .","x":"The quality of the material is good everything was fine but the reason why I booth is was because my daughter love the flower cross and it was incomplete , it was missing a flower.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B00CF2P7AY-16","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome! Make sure that you add extra pins in ...","x":"Awesome! Make sure that you add extra pins in your daughters' hair as the comb doesn't secure tightly in its place if you choose to wear your hair down. Otherwise very pretty!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2016"},{"id":"B00CF2P7AY-17","r":5.0,"t":"Wonderful addition for a 1st Holy Communion dress","x":"This veil was a great addition to my daughter's First Holy Communion dress! I loved the detail of the cross that is sewn on the back. We had many compliments on it.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B00CF2P7AY-18","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect","x":"I chose this veil with the embroidered cross because it matched so well with my granddaughter's communion dress, shoes, socks, gloves and purse.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B00CF2P7AY-19","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful and stays put","x":"This veil was perfect for my daughter\u2019s first communion.  It stayed put very nicely and was beautiful!  She said it was very comfortable, too.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B00CF2P7AY-20","r":5.0,"t":"Very nice. This veil looked really beautiful on my daughter","x":"Very nice.  This veil looked really beautiful on my daughter.  It was well made and I really like the detail of the cross.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2014"},{"id":"B00CF2P7AY-21","r":5.0,"t":"Perfectly delicate","x":"Perdectly size for an 8 year old I loved her veil and the cross such a great detail for such an important event \ud83d\udc9c","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B00CF2P7AY-22","r":5.0,"t":"Quality is good. It's maybe a little smaller than I expected","x":"Quality is good.  It's maybe a little smaller than I expected, but still very nice and worked great for us.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B00CF2P7AY-23","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"The veil was beautiful and went perfect with my granddaughter's dress. Unique with the cross on the back.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B00CF2P7AY-24","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect","x":"Ordered for my daughter\u2019s 1st Communion. She loved it and the quality was great for the price.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently describe the veil as beautiful or gorgeous.","cites":[1,2,3,5,7,8,9,11,12,13,14,15]},{"text":"The cross design is a commonly praised, distinctive feature that helps the child stand out.","cites":[1,2,3,5,7,11,14,15]},{"text":"Many reviewers report the veil fits well and stays securely in place.","cites":[1,4,7,13]},{"text":"Several reviewers praise the quality and material as good and not flimsy.","cites":[5,7,9,12]},{"text":"A few reviewers note construction or appearance issues, such as poor securing of the embroidered piece or the cross looking like a plus sign.","cites":[6,10]}]},"qa":[]}